{"thread":{"threadID":4577,"boardID":121,"topic":"Minecraft cg13","time":1498814919,"userID":2326,"username":"Unicorn24","lastPostTime":1499355446,"lastPoster":"Mike","replies":9,"views":78,"attachments":0,"isSticky":0,"isClosed":0,"cumulativeLikes":2},"tags":[],"posts":[{"postID":68001,"threadID":4577,"userID":2326,"username":"Unicorn24","subject":"Minecraft cg13","time":1498814919,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":2,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2404,"username":"Mas0n","time":1498816325,"value":1},{"userID":2378,"username":"Verdia","time":1498819653,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Hey,<br>wie vielleicht einige TTT-Spieler schon wissen gibt es auf der Map minecraft_cg13: Taser, ein Tisch der einem 200hp verleiht und ein Bett, dass einen ebenfalls heilen kann. Meiner Meinung nach sollte diese Map entfernt werden. Die Tatsache, dass es unendlich Taser gibt und man sozusagen unendlich Leben haben kann macht diese Map OP und unspielbar. Bitte entfernen oder bearbeiten. Ich wäre eher für die Idee die Map zu entfernen, da wir schon eine ähnliche Map haben.<br>LG</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":68002,"threadID":4577,"userID":1812,"username":"Mike","subject":"","time":1498817101,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2326,"username":"Unicorn24","time":1498825134,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Dafür aus o.g. Gründen</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":68004,"threadID":4577,"userID":2043,"username":"ApudoX","subject":"","time":1498818506,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Dagegen. So eine Map gabs auf Jail genauso nur mit 200Kevlar. Die map wird auch nicht rausgenommen.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Außerdem wird die map nicht alle 1-2 Maps gespielt, da geht&#x27;s das klar das man mit der AWP 2x Hitten muss, Ist eh so bei den meisten wegen extra hp</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":68005,"threadID":4577,"userID":1812,"username":"Mike","subject":"","time":1498818709,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":2,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2378,"username":"Verdia","time":1498819649,"value":1},{"userID":2326,"username":"Unicorn24","time":1498825128,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Es geht aber mehr darum, dass du kostenlos HP auffüllen kannst (sowohl als Inno als auch als T) und es einfach auch für jeden Lulatsch nen Zeus gibt. Diese werden leider auch genutzt und machen so das Spiel kaputt</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":68006,"threadID":4577,"userID":2378,"username":"Verdia","subject":"","time":1498819685,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2326,"username":"Unicorn24","time":1498825124,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Bin ich auch dafür, die Map versaut jeglichen Spielspass</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":68049,"threadID":4577,"userID":1981,"username":"LincolnlareN","subject":"","time":1498854804,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2326,"username":"Unicorn24","time":1498854859,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Raus damit</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":68056,"threadID":4577,"userID":2373,"username":"Hades","subject":"","time":1498855256,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Die Map sollte entfernt werden.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":68077,"threadID":4577,"userID":1812,"username":"Mike","subject":"","time":1498911388,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p><a href=\"https://youtu.be/68_qhm5T3sA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"></a></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>bitte endlich entfernen</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":68085,"threadID":4577,"userID":2043,"username":"ApudoX","subject":"","time":1498915826,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Eindeutig gecampt.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>btw. Ich kann dir aimcoaching anbieten <span class=\"archive-emoji\">😏</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":68490,"threadID":4577,"userID":1812,"username":"Mike","subject":"","time":1499355446,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>push</p>","polls":[]}]}